WEBVTT

00:13:28.596 --> 00:13:32.836
that you're just now starting to bring
women and different generations.

00:13:32.836 --> 00:13:35.436
And I guess could you talk
about some of the other gaps

00:13:35.476 --> 00:13:37.916
and why it's been important
to also think about some

00:13:37.916 --> 00:13:41.036
of the other studies out there
on life and happiness?

00:13:41.756 --> 00:13:43.556
RW: Yes, that's a really good point,

00:13:43.596 --> 00:13:47.756
because, particularly
in this kind of research,

00:13:47.796 --> 00:13:51.436
no single study is proof of anything.

00:13:51.436 --> 00:13:56.516
That what we want is for different
studies of different populations.

00:13:56.556 --> 00:13:59.636
So different ethnic groups,
different cultural groups,

00:13:59.676 --> 00:14:01.876
different geographies, right?